1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,350
Hi, I'm Naman from Mixar.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:06,200
Over the next few minutes, I'll show you around your app.

3
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,250
This is your viewport.

4
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:10,300
A 3D space you can move around in.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
Middle-drag to orbit, scroll to zoom.

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
Shift and middle-drag to pan.

7
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,160
Go on, give it a spin.

8
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,700
Click to select, then G to move,

9
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,600
R to rotate, S to scale.

10
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,410
Here are some handy shortcuts.

11
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:29,500
See the little island below? That's Mixie, your agent.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,180
Click to open it.

13
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,700
Mixie has tabs.

14
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:38,800
In Agent, say what you want in plain words. It works on your scene.

15
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,300
The agent uses models like Tripo, Meshy and Nano Banana.

16
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,180
For more control, open the other tabs:

17
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:49,730
3D, Image, Video or World Model.

18
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:53,090
Choose a model and adjust its settings.

19
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,730
Everything you generate lands in the library.

20
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:58,700
Your generations are right here.

21
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:03,000
You can even link your own library so the agent uses your assets,

22
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,320
saving you credits.

23
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:09,550
At the top left is the scenes drawer.

24
00:01:09,550 --> 00:01:12,980
Each scene has its own tab and Mixie agent.

25
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:17,010
Run tasks side by side and switch between them anytime.

26
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:21,100
When your scene is ready, switch to Cinema Mode

27
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,510
to direct the camera and build video workflows.

28
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,700
Ideas start in 2D.

29
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:29,860
Pull the moodboard from the right, or press tilde.

30
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:33,500
It's a canvas for references and concepts.

31
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,270
Drop images, videos or sketches here.

32
00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:40,930
Build node graphs for generative models, like in ComfyUI.

33
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:44,400
You're in Zen Mode, the simplest view.

34
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,840
If you know Blender, switch to Engine Mode.

35
00:01:47,770 --> 00:01:51,900
The full Blender workspace is there, with every panel and shortcut.

36
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:56,400
Mixie works in both. Choose what feels right for you.

37
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,570
Let's head back to Zen Mode.

38
00:01:58,230 --> 00:02:02,200
Our creative partner program gives you credits

39
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:05,900
and a community shaping the future of AI and 3D.

40
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:08,550
That's it. You know where everything is.

41
00:02:08,550 --> 00:02:10,240
Now let's make 3D together.
